crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_partial_notation.sky:9:5: error: `∂position/∂t` is a function, and must be called where it is written
  |
9 | a = ∂position/∂t
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^ not called
  = note: Sky has no function values yet: a function can be called, but not stored or passed around
  = help: pass the arguments of the function: `(∂position/∂t)(...)`, or name the derivative with a `def` that calls it

