crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_partial_notation.sky:11:7: error: `∂` needs a function defined with `def`
   |
11 | c = (∂x/∂t)(1 s)
   |       ^ this is length
   = note: `∂f/∂t` is the derivative of a function, not of a quantity that depends on another: Sky has no dependent variables
