crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_partial_notation.sky:16:5: error: `∂position/∂t(2 s)` is not a derivative: it divides `∂position` by `∂` of a call
   |
16 | h = ∂position/∂t(2 s)
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this is `∂t(2 s)`
   = note: a call binds tighter than `∂`, so the arguments belong to `t`
   = help: call the derivative: `(∂position/∂t)(2 s)`
